ViSS: Visible-State Supervision and Test-Time Causal View Search

This source release is derived from the ViSS research repository and carries
that repository's Apache License 2.0, supplied in LICENSE.

The code uses external libraries including PyTorch, Transformers, Accelerate,
DeepSpeed, qwen-vl-utils, Decord, NumPy, and Pillow. Those projects retain
their own licenses. Qwen3-VL model weights, training media, benchmark data,
and official benchmark scorers are not redistributed in this archive.

Evaluation adapters preserve the StreamingBench/SimpleStream prompt interface
and OVO-Bench task interfaces described in the evaluation protocol.
Users must obtain the corresponding resources under their original terms.

The README organization takes inspiration from the OneStreamer repository.
No OneStreamer implementation, model weights, data, or figures are included.
